*
!hosted-agent/
!hosted-agent/**
!src/
!src/**
src/node_modules/

# Skills the runtime does not deploy. These stay in the repository but must not
# reach the image, so they are also declared `off` in src/skill-availability.json
# and the Dockerfile asserts the two agree. Keep both lists in step.
#
# Each one is listed twice. The directory line alone is enough for BuildKit,
# which stops walking an excluded directory; ACR's remote builder uses the
# classic engine, where the earlier `!src/**` re-includes every file inside it
# again and the skill ships anyway. The `/**` line excludes the contents by
# name, so both engines agree.
src/skills/content-research-writer
src/skills/content-research-writer/**
src/skills/faq-knowledge-base-agent
src/skills/faq-knowledge-base-agent/**
src/skills/mcp-builder
src/skills/mcp-builder/**
src/skills/ppt-outline
src/skills/ppt-outline/**
src/skills/seo-optimizer
src/skills/seo-optimizer/**
